	"data": "The Local AI Infrastructure Stack is Becoming Real\n\nWhat I Found\n\nFour developments in the last 30-60 days, each solving a different layer of the same problem: making local AI a first-class computing paradigm, not a fallback when cloud is unavailable or too expensive.\n\nLayer 1: Compute — NVIDIA PAIR (Personal AI Router)\n\nNVIDIA PAIR (beta, Sept 3 2026) is free open-source software that turns household PCs into a personal AI inference cluster. Install on each machine, pair via 6-digit PIN +…",
